## Why This Is Asked
The task validates non-branching bit tricks and understanding of parity.

## Key Concepts
- Bitwise folding, XOR, parity, non-branching.
- Safe edge case handling (x==0).
- Extensibility to wider widths.

## Code Example
```javascript
int parity64(uint64_t x) {
  x ^= x >> 1;
  x ^= x >> 2;
  x ^= x >> 4;
  x ^= x >> 8;
  x ^= x >> 16;
  x ^= x >> 32;
  return x & 1;
}
```

